r or inflammatory markers is weak evidence for infection)", "Metabolic Aetiology: Hypercalcemia could be due to malignancy, but no other primary signs like bone pain or renal failure mentioned", "Diabetic Complication: No evidence of acute metabolic derangement (euglycemic, normal renal function for diabetes patient)"], "alarm_features": ["Unintentional weight loss", "Fatigue with constitutional symptoms", "Leukocytosis with elevated alkaline phosphatase", "Hypercalcemia"]}, "branches": {"B1": {"id": "B1", "label": "Chronic Myeloproliferative Neoplasm (chronic/accelerated phase)", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "expanded", "prior": 0.0, "posterior": 0.5192307692307693, "danger": 0.6, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": ["B1.1", "B1.2", "B1.3", "B1.4"], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.5, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.85, "interrupt_relevance": 0.4, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "management_pathway", "representative_diseases": ["chronic myeloid leukemia", "polycythemia vera", "essential thrombocythemia", "primary myelofibrosis"]}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Lymphoproliferative / Plasma Cell Disorder", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.2622377622377622, "posterior": 0.2622377622377622, "danger": 0.8, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.75, "interrupt_relevance": 0.7, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "anatomy", "representative_diseases": []}, "B3": {"id": "B3", "label": "Reactive / Non-malignant Leukocytosis", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.1311188811188811, "posterior": 0.1311188811188811, "danger": 0.2, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_co